<title>USA: Palm Harbor names president to CEO as well.</title>
<headline>Palm Harbor names president to CEO as well.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palm Harbor Homes Inc said Thursday that Larry Keener will add the title of chief executive to that of president, which he presently holds.</p>
<p>Lee Posey will step down as CEO but remain chairman when Keener takes the post June 1, the company said.</p>
